---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import EmergencyHub from '../components/EmergencyHub.astro';

const successUrl = Astro.url.origin + '/sukses';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Hubungi Kami"
  description="Hubungi Aurelius & Associates. Isi formulir konsultasi rahasia atau aktifkan layanan darurat hukum 24/7."
>

  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container">

      <EmergencyHub />

      <div class="grid-2 contact-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="badge-gold">Hubungi Kami</span>
          <h1 class="section-heading">Formulir Konsultasi</h1>

          <form action="https://formspree.io/f/luqi.akhilfa@gmail.com" method="POST" class="form-stack">
            <input type="text" name="_gotcha" hidden tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
            <input type="hidden" name="_next" value={successUrl} />

            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="form-field">
                <label class="form-label" for="form-name">Nama Lengkap *</label>
                <input class="form-input glass" type="text" id="form-name" name="name" required placeholder="Contoh: Adrian Aurelius" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-field">
                <label class="form-label" for="form-phone">Nomor WhatsApp *</label>
                <input class="form-input glass" type="tel" id="form-phone" name="phone" required placeholder="Contoh: 085171605225" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="form-field">
                <label class="form-label" for="form-email">Alamat Email *</label>
                <input class="form-input glass" type="email" id="form-email" name="email" required placeholder="nama@perusahaan.com" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-field">
                <label class="form-label" for="form-category">Kategori Hukum *</label>
                <select class="form-select glass" id="form-category" name="category" required>
                  <option value="Korporasi">Hukum Korporasi & M&A</option>
                  <option value="HAKI">Hak Kekayaan Intelektual & Teknologi</option>
                  <option value="Pidana Bisnis">Litigasi Komersial / Pidana Bisnis</option>
                  <option value="Darurat">Krisis Darurat 24/7</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-field">
              <label class="form-label" for="form-message">Kronologi Singkat / Keterangan Kasus *</label>
              <textarea class="form-textarea glass" id="form-message" name="message" required rows="5" placeholder="Tuliskan latar belakang masalah hukum Anda secara singkat..."></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="form-field">
              <label class="form-label" for="form-attachment">Lampiran Dokumen (Opsional)</label>
              <div class="file-dropzone glass-gold">
                <input type="file" id="form-attachment" name="attachment" />
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 1 0-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 2.25Z" />
                </svg>
                <span class="file-dropzone__title">Unggah Dokumen Rahasia</span>
                <span class="file-dropzone__hint">Klik atau tarik berkas ke sini. Maks. ukuran sesuai kebijakan Formspree.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold-solid btn--block">Kirim Permintaan Konsultasi</button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span class="badge-gold">Panduan Kepatuhan</span>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Panduan Penanganan Surat Perintah</h2>
          <p>Protokol hukum untuk memandu tim kepatuhan internal saat menghadapi penggeledahan aparat penegak hukum.</p>

          <div class="accordion">
            <details class="accordion-item" open>
              <summary>Langkah 1: Verifikasi Identitas & Surat Tugas</summary>
              <p>Mintalah kartu identitas resmi seluruh petugas dan Surat Perintah Penggeledahan/Penyitaan tertulis. Catat nama, institusi, dan nomor surat perintah. Pastikan tanda tangan dan cap stempel lembaga berwenang valid.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="accordion-item">
              <summary>Langkah 2: Hubungi Advokat Segera</summary>
              <p>Hubungi hotline darurat kami di <strong>+62 851-7160-5225</strong>. Anda memiliki hak konstitusional penuh di bawah KUHAP untuk didampingi penasihat hukum sebelum memberikan pernyataan atau menyerahkan dokumen.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="accordion-item">
              <summary>Langkah 3: Batasi Penggeledahan Sesuai Izin</summary>
              <p>Tunjukkan ruangan atau berkas yang hanya dicantumkan spesifik di Surat Perintah. Ajukan keberatan tertulis jika petugas mencoba menyita aset di luar deskripsi surat.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="accordion-item">
              <summary>Langkah 4: Lindungi Hak Istimewa Advokat</summary>
              <p>Nyatakan perlindungan hak istimewa advokat-klien atas korespondensi hukum perusahaan. Jangan memberikan kata sandi enkripsi data tanpa penetapan penyitaan siber pengadilan yang sah.</p>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>

<style>
  .file-dropzone {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border-gold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    text-align: center;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .file-dropzone:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-gold-dark);
    background: var(--glass-gold-bg);
  }

  .file-dropzone input[type="file"] {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    opacity: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .file-dropzone svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    color: var(--color-gold-dark);
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-3);
  }

  .file-dropzone__title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .file-dropzone__hint {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .accordion {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .accordion-item {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .accordion-item summary {
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .accordion-item summary:hover {
    background: rgba(197, 168, 128, 0.05);
  }

  .accordion-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .accordion-item summary::after {
    content: '+';
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-gold-dark);
    font-weight: 400;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .accordion-item[open] summary::after {
    content: '−';
  }

  .accordion-item p {
    padding: 0 var(--space-5) var(--space-5);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    background: var(--color-bg-white);
    margin: 0;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  html.dark-mode .accordion-item p {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
  }

  .contact-grid {
    gap: var(--space-16);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: var(--space-16);
  }

  .contact-grid h1,
  .contact-grid h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-grid {
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }
  }
</style>
